# Legacy hostname redirect — dmtclearinghouse.esipfed.org, owned by ESIP.
#
# Model proposed to ESIP: they create ONE DNS-only (grey-cloud) CNAME
#   dmtclearinghouse.esipfed.org  CNAME  legacy.dmtc-prod.org
# and never touch it again. legacy.dmtc-prod.org is an A record in the
# Hover zone we control, pointing at this droplet. Caddy obtains a certificate
# for the ESIP name (traffic reaches us, so the HTTP-01 challenge succeeds) and
# issues a permanent redirect that preserves path and query, so every old
# bookmark, citation and search-engine link lands on the current site. Where
# it redirects to is then a one-line change on our side, with no ESIP ticket.
#
# Enable by renaming to legacy.caddy AFTER ESIP's CNAME is live, then
# `make prod-reload`. Set LEGACY_HOST in .env.prod (default below).

{$LEGACY_HOST:dmtclearinghouse.esipfed.org} {
	redir https://{$PROD_HOST}{uri} permanent
}

legacy.{$PROD_APEX} {
	redir https://{$PROD_HOST}{uri} permanent
}
